Subject: [PATCH 05/33] gfx1100 dense GEMVs: a row's loads first at 1-4 columns
 (g11), four rows a wave at 1-6 columns (R4)

Port of opt7/integrate a77f06e4 d59a5fc1 a7079ed6 c88536ed 102e08a3 21476cfc fe97bee1 onto v0.2.9: native_mmvq's
IQ4_XS / Q4_K / Q5_K / Q6_K / IQ3_S calls of 1-6 columns at 2560 inputs (IQ4_XS 6144) and the Q5_K vocabulary head
take gfx1100 kernels with plain q8_1 columns and exact float products, picked per shape by measured thresholds
(r4_from); every output bitwise native_mmvq's own kernels (mmvq_g11_parity: T 1-6, four grids). After v0.2.9's
split of calls with more columns than a launch takes. STRATA_MMVQ_G11=0 / STRATA_MMVQ_R4=0 turn them off.
Measured on 0.1.43: GPU wait -0.4 to -0.6 ms a round (~4%); R4 at 5-6 tokens qkv 76-87 -> 29-34 us, edit +6%.
